OL,3,GNEWSAAttendance drive 'highlights
OL,4,Aschool positives'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaign to boost attendance in
OL,7,FGuernsey's state schools has been
OL,8,Flaunched to identify issues around what
OL,9,Fis stopping children attending school.
OL,11,FFigures showed attendance in secondary
OL,12,Fschools dropped by over 5% between 2021
OL,13,Fand 2025, with a rate of 87.6% last
OL,14,Fyear.
OL,16,FNick Hynes, Director of Education, said
OL,17,Ftackling poor attendance was a
OL,18,F"complicated issue".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
