OL,3,GNEWSAAttendance drive 'highlights
OL,4,Aschool positives'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Emma Moore from the National
OL,7,FFoundation for Educational Research
OL,8,Fsaid schools needed the support of
OL,9,F"families and wider services" to tackle
OL,10,Fincreasing absences.
